title: "PMJAY Denial Advocate"
abstract: >-
  A free, independent tool and agent skill that helps Indian families check
  whether a hospital's Ayushman Bharat (PM-JAY) coverage denial is correct,
  search verified Health Benefit Package codes and indicative rates, and find
  a care-first next step.
